      "body": "This is a bug fix release with minor additions.\r\n\r\n* Φ-Flow now assigns item names more aggressively.\r\n* Fix `functional_gradient` return value for Jax\r\n* Fix `dense_net` implementations\r\n* Fix `make_incompressible` tracing errors\r\n* Matplotlib plots now support animations\r\n* Support PointCloud vector plots\r\n* Gather & mask is now supported by `tensor[dict]`\r\n* `vis.plot()` no longer auto-displays the plot in notebooks. No need for semicolons anymore.",
