      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tum-pbs/PhiFlow/pulls/31",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/tum-pbs/PhiFlow/pull/31",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/tum-pbs/PhiFlow/pull/31.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/tum-pbs/PhiFlow/pull/31.patch",
        "merged_at": "2021-06-19T10:03:03Z"
      },
      "body": "Φ-Flow version 2 is the first major update since public release.\r\nThis is the third release candidate, see #27 and #29 for the previous ones.\r\n\r\n**Changes**\r\n\r\n* Explicit dimension types with `spatial`, `channel`, `batch`, `collection`.\r\n* Instantiation of `CenteredGrid` and `StaggeredGrid` via constructors\r\n* StaggeredGrids now only store neccesary values.\r\n* Rework solver API.\r\n* `StaggeredGrid.x` now returns a dimension reference. To get a component, use `StaggeredGrid.vector['x']` instead.\r\n* Replace `ModuleViewer` by `view()`.\r\n* Rename backend constants, such as `SCIPY_BACKEND` to `NUMPY`.\r\n\r\n**Additions**\r\n\r\n* Full support for `math.jit_compile()`\r\n* Functional math functions now support `TensorLike` types, such as `Geometry` or `Grid` objects.\r\n* Add graph view to Φ-Board, `App.log_scalar()`\r\n* Add DLPack conversion with `convert`\r\n* Math: add `custom_gradient`, `seed`, `native_call`, `copy`, `reshaped_native`, `reshaped_tensor`\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this update features improved testing, documentation and bug fixes.\r\nSome missing functions were implemented.",
